@prefix eco: <https://ggen.dev/ecosystem#> . @prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> . eco:VerificationCrown a skos:Concept; skos:inScheme eco:VerificationEvidenceScheme; skos:prefLabel "Verification Crown"; skos:definition "A verification state requiring exact-subject observed execution before ALIVE standing." .